      "body": "Over the last 90 days, the stock has risen 15% to ₹558. The fair value is estimated to be ₹448, however this is not to be taken as a sell recommendation but rather should be used as a guide only. Revenue has declined by 12% over the last 3 years. Earnings per share has declined by 27%.",
